            <ArticleTitle>When can infants and children benefit from probiotics?</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>789-794</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The latest studies indicate that probiotics can help with colic, eczema, and certain types of diarrhea. They may also help with upper respiratory infections and IBS pain.</AbstractText>
